---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";
import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="Inventory Manager" current="inventory">
  <header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your stock, accounted for</div><h1>Inventory Manager</h1><p>Track catalogue products, stock movements and low-stock thresholds.</p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="/catalogue/">Product catalogue</a></header>
  <p id="inventory-plan" class="workspace-plan"></p><p id="inventory-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="workspace-status"></p>
  <section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Inventory overview</h2><div id="inventory-totals" class="workspace-actions"></div><p id="inventory-valuation"></p><p>Valuation uses purchase prices, grouped by currency. Missing prices are excluded and reported. Low-stock alerts appear here and in the stock list.</p></section>
  <div class="workspace-grid"><section class="workspace-panel"><h2 id="inventory-edit-title">Track a product</h2><form id="inventory-save"><fieldset id="inventory-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label class="wide">Find a saved product<input id="inventory-product-search" type="search" maxlength="100" /></label><button type="button" id="inventory-find" class="button button-secondary">Find products</button><label class="wide">Product<select id="inventory-product" required></select></label><label>Low-stock threshold<input id="inventory-threshold" type="number" value="0" min="0" max="1000000000" required /></label><label>Storage location<input id="inventory-location" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Purchase price per unit<input id="inventory-purchase" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" /><small>Selling price, supplier and category are managed in the catalogue.</small></label><label>Purchase currency<select id="inventory-currency"><option>USD</option><option>EUR</option><option>GBP</option></select></label><label><span>Archive record (zero stock only)</span><input id="inventory-archived" type="checkbox" /></label><div class="workspace-actions wide"><button type="submit" class="button button-signal">Save inventory record</button><button type="button" id="inventory-new" class="button button-secondary">New record</button></div></div></fieldset></form></section>
  <section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Stock movement</h2><form id="inventory-move"><fieldset id="inventory-move-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><p id="inventory-selected" class="wide">Select a stock record below.</p><label>Units to add or remove<input id="inventory-delta" type="number" step="1" min="-1000000000" max="1000000000" required /><small>Use a negative number to remove stock. Stock cannot go below zero.</small></label><label class="wide">Reason<input id="inventory-reason" maxlength="500" required placeholder="Delivery, sale, return, correction…" /></label><button type="submit" class="button button-signal">Record movement</button></div></fieldset></form><p>Movement history is append-only. Correct a mistake by recording a compensating movement. Retrying a request does not apply it twice.</p><a id="inventory-labels" href="/label-studio/">Design product labels</a></section></div>
  <section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Stock register</h2><form id="inventory-search" class="workspace-form"><label>Product, SKU or scanned barcode<input id="inventory-q" type="search" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Location<input id="inventory-filter-location" maxlength="200" /></label><label><span>Low stock only</span><input id="inventory-low" type="checkbox" /></label><label><span>Show archived</span><input id="inventory-show-archived" type="checkbox" /></label><button type="submit" class="button button-secondary">Search stock</button></form><div class="workspace-actions">{["csv","xlsx","json"].map(format=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-inventory-export={format}>Export {format.toUpperCase()}</button>)}</div><div class="workspace-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Inventory"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Location</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button type="button" id="inventory-prev" class="button button-secondary">Previous</button><span id="inventory-page"></span><button type="button" id="inventory-next" class="button button-secondary">Next</button></div></section>
  <section id="inventory-history" class="workspace-panel" hidden><h2>Movement history</h2><div class="workspace-table-wrap"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Change</th><th>Balance</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-history-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="inventory-history-prev" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Previous</button><span id="inventory-history-page"></span><button id="inventory-history-next" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Next</button></div></section>
</AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/inventory.ts"></script>
